flowchart TD
    A[User development request] --> B[Agent inspects repository]
    B --> C[Agent prepares file proposal]
    C --> D[Persist proposed diff + hunks]
    D --> E[User opens Changes]
    E --> F{Accept all hunks?}
    F -- No --> G[Select wanted hunks]
    F -- Yes --> H[Apply selected/all hunks]
    G --> H
    H --> I[Write repository file]
    I --> J[Refresh Git diff]
    J --> K[Run tests/build]
    K --> L{Verification passes?}
    L -- No --> M[Fix or prepare new proposal]
    M --> C
    L -- Yes --> N[Stage + commit]

    D --> R[Reject proposal]
    I --> V{Later revert requested?}
    V -- Yes --> W{Current file still matches applied state?}
    W -- Yes --> X[Conflict-safe revert]
    W -- No --> Y[Refuse blind revert; inspect Git/history]
